<title>USA: Colo. $32 mln water bonds repriced, 1998 yield cut.</title>
<headline>Colo. $32 mln water bonds repriced, 1998 yield cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc. said Wednesday it repriced Colorado Water Resources and Power Development Authority's $31.6 million bond deal, lowering the yield in 1998 to 4.05 percent from 4.10 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:  </p>
<p>COLORADO WATER RESOURSES AND POWER</p>
<p>DEVELOPMENT AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $31,635,000*</p>
<p>CLEAN WATER REVENUE BONDS, 1997 SERIES A (SRF)</p>
<p>THIS ISSUE WILL BE IN BOOK ENTRY FORM THROUGH THE FACILITIES</p>
<p>OF DTC</p>
<p>NOTE THE REPRICING OF MATURITY 1998.</p>
<p>  MOODY'S: Aa2		   S&amp;P: AA		    FITCH: NAF</p>
<p>	     Confirmed		  Confirmed</p>
<p>  DATED: 05/01/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 09/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 09/01</p>
<p>ALL BONDS ARE PRICED AT PAR.</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON</p>
